 ps://www.darkreading.com/cloud-security/us-space-force-wants-700m-cyberse
 curity">$700 million budget request by the Space Force</a> for this purpo
 se alone. At the same time\, <a href="https://www.inc.com/heather-wilde/h
 arness-power-of-space-cybersecurity-for-growth-opportunity.html">a fast-g
 rowing market has emerged</a>\, with demand for professionals and firms.<
 /p><p>  Participants in the Space Cybersecurity Digital Badge program wil
 l gain in-depth understanding of the various cyber threats to space syste
 ms as well as techniques\, tools\, and best practices to address those th
 reats. At the end of the program\, participants will have the capability 
